{"2535920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Reach the light", "steam_appid": 2535920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<strong>“Reach the light” is a difficult precision platformer with varied challenges throughout the world. Although the hardest one is the one that takes you to the light…</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple platforms with tricky behaviors and mechanics.<br></li><li>Ball costumes.<br></li><li>Extra challenges to beat.<br></li><li>Twitch integration.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/522b98ed13a49b6dfebc7105abd0499f.poster.avif?t=1767282074\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/522b98ed13a49b6dfebc7105abd0499f.webm?t=1767282074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/522b98ed13a49b6dfebc7105abd0499f.mp4?t=1767282074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Use two jumps that are recharged over time to climb the mountain. It is a hard challenge to maintain balance and make accurate jumps on platforms.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/07d22c60f60a979c75041c3b27bcaf8f.poster.avif?t=1767282074\" width=560 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/07d22c60f60a979c75041c3b27bcaf8f.webm?t=1767282074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2535920/extras/07d22c60f60a979c75041c3b27bcaf8f.mp4?t=1767282074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></s